title: 'pallet-psm: report the real instance footprint to the creation Consideration'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `create_psm` previously established the creation `Consideration` with a placeholder
    footprint of one item and zero bytes, under-reporting what the call actually writes.
    A new `Pallet::psm_creation_footprint` helper now reports the `Psm` and `PsmAdmin`
    entries (two items, max-encoded-len sized) and is used by the extrinsic and the
    benchmarks.
crates:
- name: pallet-psm
  bump: minor
